      "id": "claim_19cc6271fdea45e2b1a0ed7b58c33fc7",
      "statement": "The production decoder configuration is a 16-layer model with d_model=1024, 8 query heads, 4 key/value heads, head_dim=128, d_ff=4096, vocab_size=128000, seq_len=2048, and rope_theta=500000.0.",
