    {
      "id": "claim_9075a9842dde41759ed421b510c15e81",
      "statement": "The decoder stack is pre-norm and preserves residual width: each DecoderBlock performs x = x + attention(attention_norm(x)) followed by x = x + ffn(ffn_norm(x)), and Decoder applies a final RMSNorm after all layers.",
