      "statement": "RMSNorm computes x * rsqrt(mean(x.pow(2), dim=-1, keepdim=True) + eps) * weight with a learnable d_model- or head_dim-width weight; qknorm optionally applies per-head RMSNorm to projected Q and K before RoPE, while qknorm=False uses Identity modules.",
